# Contract fixtures for the evaluation harness.
#
# Every .txt here is a real commercial contract from CUAD v1 (the Contract
# Understanding Atticus Dataset, https://www.atticusprojectai.org/cuad),
# reproduced verbatim under CC BY 4.0. They are checked in so `run_eval` works
# without a CUAD checkout; regenerate them with
#
#     python -m scripts.build_cuad_fixtures --cuad ~/project/cuad
#
# which also rewrites data/gold/annotations.jsonl. Do not edit a .txt by hand:
# the gold spans are character offsets into its normalized text, so any edit
# silently invalidates the annotations.
